#: ../../reference/schemas.md:17
msgid "仓库里的 `schemas/` 目录是同一投影的确定性提交版本；契约测试要求模型修改后重新生成 schema，且归一化 JSON 字节完全一致。模型与 schema 必须在同一次改动里更新。"
msgstr "The repository's `schemas/` directory is the deterministic committed projection; contract tests regenerate the schema after model changes and require byte-equivalent normalized JSON. Model and schema must be updated in the same change."
